<title>USA: U.S. barge rates - No bids or offers on call.</title>
<headline>U.S. barge rates - No bids or offers on call.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barge rates had no bids or offers on southbound barge freight, the St. Louis Merchants Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>No barges traded versus none on Friday.  </p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-3720)</p>
</text>
